  "decision_summary": "The query is linezolid, an oxazolidinone antibiotic with established CNS penetration. High-similarity analogues with the same core and acetamidomethyl side chain show brain-to-plasma AUC ratios of 1.69–3.49 in mice, providing strong transferable evidence for meaningful brain access. The meningitis condition does not negate this; rather, adequate CNS exposure is expected.",
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct human CSF or meningitis-specific PK measurement for the query was present in the retrieved evidence, though the high-similarity mouse B/P data and known linezolid CNS behavior strongly support the prediction."
